    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36570" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plantātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		planto. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A setting</i>, <i>planting</i>, <i>transplanting</i> (post-Aug.), <i><span class="en">Plin. 21, 4,
				10, § 17</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A plant set out</i> or <i>transplanted</i> (late Lat.), <i><span class="en">Vulg. Isa.
				17, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Matt. 15, 13</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
